    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37126" root="كلأ" body-key="k">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكتلأ مِنْهُ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>He preserved,</i> or <i>guarded, himself from him</i> or <i>it; had a care of,</i> or <i>was
cautious of, him</i> or <i>it.</i> (S, K. *) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكتلأت عَيْنى</span>
(assumed tropical:)  <i>My eye was wakeful, vigilant,</i> or <i>cautious.</i> (S.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكتلأ كُلْأَةً</span>, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تكلّأها</span></b> , <i>He received a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُلْأَة</span>
[i. e., <i>an earnest,</i> or <i>money paid in advance</i>].
(K.)

